   "confidence": "low",
   "notes": "Former Central Cinema (1930 Art Deco), 21 Hobson St: white glazed faience tiling (rendered finish used), dark plinth band. Stepped central frontispiece with three tall vertical window strips, Art Deco reliefs and a raised parapet; projecting flat canopy over the entrance steps and doors; narrow left pier with small windows; right wing with two windows on each upper floor over a tall service door. Photo 2016 (vacant); later refurbishment not checked. Bay positions estimated from one oblique CC BY-SA 2.0 geograph photo."
